# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Ice Parlor
---
The Ice Parlor is a cheerful room full of popsicles, every one of them colorful, delicious and sincerely devoted to ending your life.

Here {name} learned two lessons: that hearts are precious, and that blue raspberry is a liar. Neither lesson was pleasant. The second was also sticky.

The shimmer hovered over the freezer for a moment and then vanished, with the unbearable confidence of something that knows there will be a sequel.
